  The reel_script says the accident happened on the way back from Thiruchendur, but the article only says the group was returning to Bengaluru after a performance; Thiruchendur is not named as the performance location in the article (the article says the performance was in Thiruchendur, so this is consistent) — however the reel_script says the car 'நிலைதடுமாறி' (lost control), which is not stated in the article
  The reel_script and slides say the Bengaluru family was 'பயணித்த' and that 'புதன்கிழமை இரவு' the car hit the wall, but the article says the group was returning on Wednesday night; the draft's claim that the car was carrying Dakshinamoorthy's family as the 'Bengaluru' group is accurate, but the reel_script omits that the injured included 'ஓட்டுநர்' only in the slides—minor, not a problem
  The caption says the car 'பயணித்த' belonged to Bengaluru family and that the group went 'திருச்செந்தூர்' for the performance, but the article places the performance trip starting from Bengaluru to Thiruchendur; the caption's 'திருச்செந்தூர் சென்று' is consistent
  The reel_script states the family was 'பெங்களூரைச் சேர்ந்த தட்சிணாமூர்த்தி' but the article only says Dakshinamoorthy and his family were travelling; attributing Bengaluru residence to Dakshinamoorthy specifically is an inference not explicitly stated
  The slides_spec 'யார் பயணித்தனர்?' slide says 'பரதநாட்டிய நிகழ்ச்சிக்குப் பின் பெங்களூருக்குத் திரும்பினர்' and the caption's 'தேசிய நெடுஞ்சாலையில்' location is fine, but the caption also says the accident happened 'புதுச்சத்திரம் பகுதியில்' which matches the article
